  | sieve                                                         |
  |                                                               |
  |        __/|                                        |\__       |
  |     __/car|........................................|   \__    |
  |   _/      |           :                            |      \_  |
----><_       |           V                            |  cons _>---->
  |    \__    |    +------------+    +------------+    |    __/   |
  |       \cdr|--->| filter:    |    | sieve      |--->| __/      |
  |          \|    |            |--->|            |    |/         |
  |                | not        |    |            |               |
  |                | divisible? |    |            |               |
  |                +------------+    +------------+               |
  +---------------------------------------------------------------+
@end example
@end ifinfo
